{{media:xiaomi:xiaomi_ac2350_main.jpeg?400|Xiaomi AIoT Router AC2350}}

The Xiaomi AIoT Router AC2350 is a dual-band 2.4/5 GHz wireless router. It has a 4 port gigabit switch with 1 WAN port and 3 LAN ports. It has 2 main high power radios with power and low noise amplifiers and a third low power IoT radio which is currently unusable due to unavailability of open source drivers. With its 7 antennas, it offers good coverage and with 3x3 (2.4GHz) and 4x4 (5GHz) WiFi it allows many devices to connect and work simultaneously. Although, the CPU is a bit weak. There are two versions of this router, a global (black) and a chineese (white) one, with no hardware differences.

